OL,3,GNEWSAFootball club apologises over
OL,4,Aon-pitch 'assault'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Sidlesham-based
OL,7,FEmsworth Town described it as an
OL,8,F"isolated incident" which did "not
OL,9,Freflect the values of our club, players
OL,10,For volunteers".
